config PWM_DWC_OF
	tristate "DesignWare PWM Controller (OF)"
	depends on OF
	depends on HAS_IOMEM
	select PWM_DWC_CORE
	help
	  PWM driver for Synopsys DWC PWM Controller attached to a
	  memory-mapped bus and described in the device tree, as found on
	  the Axera AX620E family. The register interface is the same
	  DesignWare APB timer block the PCI front end drives.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called pwm-dwc-of.
